sequenceDiagram
    participant U as LINE user
    participant L as LINE API
    participant W as Next.js webhook
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant C as Codex SDK

    U->>L: Sends a message
    L->>W: Signed webhook with LINE userId
    W->>D: Verify signature first, then dedupe and load profile
    D-->>W: Profile JSON and analysis status
    alt Duplicate event or analysis already active
        W-->>L: HTTP 200, no chat reply
    else Intake needed
        W->>C: Extract updates from text and saved profile
        C-->>W: Structured preference update
        W->>W: Check monthly rent and transport
        alt Missing required field
            W->>D: Save partial profile, no job
            W->>L: Reply with one text question
        else Profile newly complete or changed
            W->>D: Save profile and one ANALYSIS snapshot atomically
            W->>L: Reply with Flex confirmation
        else Complete and unchanged
            W->>D: Record event, no new job
        end
        W-->>L: HTTP 200
    end
    Note over W,D: An explicit retry after terminal failure queues the saved profile again
